 "results": "<section class=\"course-group\" aria-labelledby=\"group-bahasa\"><h3 class=\"course-group-heading\" id=\"group-bahasa\">Bahasa &amp; Framework<span>8 kelas</span></h3><p class=\"course-rail-hint\" id=\"rail-hint-bahasa\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>Geser untuk melihat semua kelas di bidang ini.</p><div class=\"course-grid\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"group-bahasa\" aria-describedby=\"rail-hint-bahasa\"><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"golang/\" data-folder=\"golang\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">01 / bahasa</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Go</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>Golang</h3><p>Kurikulum Go paling lengkap di sini: sintaks, konkurensi, web server, gRPC, observabilitas, sampai ujian akhir.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>goroutine</span><span>gRPC</span><span>sqlc</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>267 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"fastapi/\" data-folder=\"fastapi\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">02 / bahasa</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Py</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>FastAPI</h3><p>API Python modern: Pydantic v2, dependency injection, async, WebSocket, lifespan, dan penerapan produksi.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>Pydantic v2</span><span>async</span><span>SQLModel</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>24 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"next/\" data-folder=\"next\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">03 / bahasa</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">N/</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>Next.js</h3><p>App Router, Server Component, Server Action, caching, dan pola rendering pada Next.js versi terbaru.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>App Router</span><span>RSC</span><span>caching</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>23 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"microservices/\" data-folder=\"microservices\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">04 / bahasa</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">μs</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>Microservices</h3><p>Pemecahan layanan, komunikasi antar layanan, resilience, Saga, contract testing, dan distributed tracing.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>Saga</span><span>resilience</span><span>tracing</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>24 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"html/\" data-folder=\"html\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">05 / bahasa</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&lt;&gt;</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>HTML</h3><p>Struktur halaman web dari nol: semantik, tautan, media, tabel, formulir, aksesibilitas, metadata, dan performa.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>semantik</span><span>formulir</span><span>a11y</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>27 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"css/\" data-folder=\"css\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">06 / bahasa</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{}</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>CSS</h3><p>Selektor dan kaskade, box model, flexbox, grid, container query, warna modern, animasi, dan arsitektur CSS.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>grid</span><span>flexbox</span><span>@container</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>20 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"javascript/\" data-folder=\"javascript\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">07 / bahasa</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JS</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>JavaScript</h3><p>Bahasa web dari dasar: closure, class, event loop, async/await, fetch, DOM, modul ES, keamanan, dan pengujian.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>async</span><span>DOM</span><span>fetch</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>22 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-bahasa\" href=\"php/\" data-folder=\"php\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">08 / bahasa</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&lt;?</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Bahasa &amp; Framework</span><h3>PHP</h3><p>PHP modern untuk web: tipe, OOP, Composer, keluaran aman, PDO, kata sandi, CSRF, pengujian, dan produksi.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>PHP 8.5</span><span>PDO</span><span>OWASP</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>25 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"course-group\" aria-labelledby=\"group-data\"><h3 class=\"course-group-heading\" id=\"group-data\">Data &amp; Pesan<span>4 kelas</span></h3><p class=\"course-rail-hint\" id=\"rail-hint-data\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>Geser untuk melihat semua kelas di bidang ini.</p><div class=\"course-grid\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"group-data\" aria-describedby=\"rail-hint-data\"><a class=\"course-card tone-data\" href=\"postgresql/\" data-folder=\"postgresql\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">09 / data</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Pg</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Data &amp; Pesan</span><h3>PostgreSQL</h3><p>Arsitektur, indeks, EXPLAIN ANALYZE, MVCC dan VACUUM, partisi, replikasi, sampai migrasi tanpa downtime.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>indeks</span><span>MVCC</span><span>replikasi</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>12 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-data\" href=\"redis/\" data-folder=\"redis\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">10 / data</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Re</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Data &amp; Pesan</span><h3>Redis</h3><p>Struktur data, strategi caching, persistensi, Streams, Cluster, dan pola penguncian terdistribusi.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>cache</span><span>Streams</span><span>Cluster</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>21 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-data\" href=\"kafka/\" data-folder=\"kafka\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">11 / data</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Kf</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Data &amp; Pesan</span><h3>Apache Kafka</h3><p>Log terdistribusi, partisi dan urutan, KRaft, transaksi, Schema Registry, Connect, Streams, dan pola outbox.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>KRaft</span><span>exactly-once</span><span>outbox</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>13 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-data\" href=\"rabbitmq/\" data-folder=\"rabbitmq\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">12 / data</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Rq</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Data &amp; Pesan</span><h3>RabbitMQ</h3><p>AMQP, exchange dan routing, quorum queue, dead letter exchange, serta klaster dan ketahanan pesan.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>AMQP</span><span>quorum</span><span>DLX</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>15 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"course-group\" aria-labelledby=\"group-infra\"><h3 class=\"course-group-heading\" id=\"group-infra\">Infrastruktur<span>5 kelas</span></h3><p class=\"course-rail-hint\" id=\"rail-hint-infra\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>Geser untuk melihat semua kelas di bidang ini.</p><div class=\"course-grid\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"group-infra\" aria-describedby=\"rail-hint-infra\"><a class=\"course-card tone-infra\" href=\"nginx/\" data-folder=\"nginx\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">13 / infra</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Nx</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Infrastruktur</span><h3>Nginx</h3><p>Model proses dan konteks konfigurasi, reverse proxy, upstream, TLS, pembatasan laju, caching, dan diagnosis.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>proxy</span><span>TLS</span><span>cache</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>8 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-infra\" href=\"docker/\" data-folder=\"docker\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">14 / infra</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Dk</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Infrastruktur</span><h3>Docker</h3><p>Image dan layer, multi-stage build, Compose, BuildKit dan buildx, rootless, serta pemindaian keamanan.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>BuildKit</span><span>Compose</span><span>rootless</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>21 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-infra\" href=\"kubernetes/\" data-folder=\"kubernetes\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">15 / infra</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">K8</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Infrastruktur</span><h3>Kubernetes</h3><p>Pod sampai Deployment, Service dan Ingress, konfigurasi, penskalaan, keamanan, dan penelusuran masalah klaster.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>Deployment</span><span>Ingress</span><span>HPA</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>14 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-infra\" href=\"kong/\" data-folder=\"kong\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">16 / infra</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Kg</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Infrastruktur</span><h3>Kong</h3><p>API gateway: rute dan layanan, plugin, autentikasi, rate limiting, mode DB-less, dan Konnect.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>gateway</span><span>plugin</span><span>Konnect</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>12 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-infra\" href=\"git-ci-cd/\" data-folder=\"git-ci-cd\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">17 / infra</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Git</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Infrastruktur</span><h3>Git &amp; CI/CD</h3><p>Fondasi Git, strategi percabangan, GitHub Actions, pipeline, artefak, dan strategi rilis.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>Git</span><span>Actions</span><span>pipeline</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>20 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"course-group\" aria-labelledby=\"group-security\"><h3 class=\"course-group-heading\" id=\"group-security\">Keamanan &amp; Sistem<span>2 kelas</span></h3><p class=\"course-rail-hint\" id=\"rail-hint-security\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>Geser untuk melihat semua kelas di bidang ini.</p><div class=\"course-grid\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"group-security\" aria-describedby=\"rail-hint-security\"><a class=\"course-card tone-security\" href=\"linux/\" data-folder=\"linux\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">18 / security</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">&gt;_</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Keamanan &amp; Sistem</span><h3>Linux &amp; Shell</h3><p>Fondasi sistem untuk semua topik lain: filesystem, proses, shell, jaringan, dan operasi harian.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>shell</span><span>proses</span><span>jaringan</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>8 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-security\" href=\"keamanan/\" data-folder=\"keamanan\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">19 / security</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">{✓}</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Keamanan &amp; Sistem</span><h3>Keamanan Aplikasi</h3><p>Model ancaman, injeksi, XSS, autentikasi dan otorisasi, pengelolaan rahasia, rantai pasok, CSRF dan SSRF.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>OWASP</span><span>XSS</span><span>SSRF</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>8 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a></div></section><section class=\"course-group\" aria-labelledby=\"group-observe\"><h3 class=\"course-group-heading\" id=\"group-observe\">Observabilitas &amp; Uji<span>4 kelas</span></h3><p class=\"course-rail-hint\" id=\"rail-hint-observe\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↔</span>Geser untuk melihat semua kelas di bidang ini.</p><div class=\"course-grid\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"group-observe\" aria-describedby=\"rail-hint-observe\"><a class=\"course-card tone-observe\" href=\"opentelemetry/\" data-folder=\"opentelemetry\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">20 / observe</span><span class=\"course-badge\">baru</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Ot</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Observabilitas &amp; Uji</span><h3>OpenTelemetry</h3><p>Trace, metrik, dan log yang menyatu: instrumentasi, Collector, sampling, perambatan konteks, dan penyelidikan.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>trace</span><span>Collector</span><span>sampling</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>8 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-observe\" href=\"prometheus/\" data-folder=\"prometheus\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">21 / observe</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Pr</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Observabilitas &amp; Uji</span><h3>Prometheus</h3><p>Model metrik, PromQL, exporter, aturan perekaman, alerting, dan federation untuk skala besar.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>PromQL</span><span>exporter</span><span>alert</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>15 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-observe\" href=\"grafana/\" data-folder=\"grafana\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">22 / observe</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Gr</span><span class=\"course-domain\">Observabilitas &amp; Uji</span><h3>Grafana</h3><p>Panel dan visualisasi, variabel, transformasi data, alerting terpadu, dan provisioning sebagai kode.</p><div class=\"course-tags\"><span>panel</span><span>variabel</span><span>provisioning</span></div><div class=\"course-footer\"><span>15 modul</span><span>Masuk kelas <b aria-hidden=\"true\">→</b></span></div></a><a class=\"course-card tone-observe\" href=\"k6/\" data-folder=\"k6\"><div class=\"course-top\"><span class=\"course-number\">23 / observe</span></div><span class=\"course-icon\" aria-hidde